---
/** Skeleton: the shape of a card that is on its way: a circle, two lines and a block, in the chip tone. */
---

<span class="cover-sheet cover-stack" style="width:196px; padding:16px; --gap:14px">
  <span class="cover-line" style="--gap:12px">
    <i class="cover-tone cover-skeleton cover-round" style="width:36px; height:36px"></i>
    <span class="cover-stack" style="--gap:10px">
      <i class="cover-tone cover-skeleton" style="width:96px; height:10px"></i>
      <i class="cover-tone cover-skeleton" style="width:60px; height:10px"></i>
    </span>
  </span>
  <i class="cover-tone cover-skeleton" style="height:40px"></i>
</span>
